        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia REEDDB, Single Cylinder Sunburst Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sunburst Single Cylinder Deadbolt has a unique style that is both ornate and beautiful. It is available in 4 finishes exclusive to Omnia's Classico Collection--specially designed to make the intricate details of this deadbolt shine. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel finishes. Omnia's REEDDB Single Cylinder Sunburst Deadbolt is available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets with 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" door thicknesses. \r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC2_size.gif?v=1704354724\" width=\"544\" height=\"201\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia REEDDB Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sunburst Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 cylinder with collar, 1 thumbturn, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, strike, and dust box.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia REEDDB Single Cylinder Classico Collection Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Overall Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia FLORDB Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sunburst Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "Omnia REEDDB, Sunburst Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The Sunburst Single Cylinder Deadbolt has a unique style that is both ornate and beautiful. It is available in 4 finishes exclusive to Omnia's Classico Collection--specially designed to make the intricate details of this deadbolt shine. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel finishes. Omnia's REEDDB Single Cylinder Sunburst Deadbolt is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets with 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, 2 inch door thicknesses.",
